 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hello there! How's your day treating you?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.61,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_25"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'm alright, a bit tired.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.49,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_05"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'm four months pregnant and I've got an interview next week. Do I have to tell them?",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 0.53,
   "block": "job_interview.dlg24",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "No, you're not legally required to tell them in many countries, and they shouldn't ask. It's your choice.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 0.86,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg24"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "But won't it feel sneaky if I get the job?",
   "est_sec": 3.2,
   "gap_before": 0.33,
   "block": "job_interview.dlg24",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Not at all. Lots of people choose to mention it after an offer, when it's about planning, not hiring.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 0.76,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg24"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "What if I start showing by then?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.74,
   "block": "job_interview.dlg24",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then it's up to you whether you say anything. Focus on your skills, that's what the interview is for.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 1.55,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg24"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I just don't want it",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 3.18,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg24"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "to count against me.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 2.26,
   "block": "job_interview.dlg24",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That's understandable. If it ever seemed to affect their decision, that would be discrimination, and you'd have the right to challenge it.",
   "est_sec": 6.92,
